0,Trans–New Guinea languages - Wikipedia,https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Trans–New_Guinea_languages,"Trans–New Guinea (TNG) is an extensive family of Papuan languages spoken on the island of New Guinea and neighboring islands, a region corresponding to the country Papua New Guinea as well as parts of Indonesia.",Rumu,Trans-New Guinea
